# whose retirement stream runs to within two cycles of the last observed cycle. It does NOT say the case is
# unreachable, and the red is OWED.
# WHAT IT NEEDS: a run whose retirement stream stops WELL BEFORE the run's end while lookups and injections
# continue, so an injection can sit after the last retirement with its whole alert window still inside the observed
# region. Concretely, a WFI or an otherwise stalled core that keeps fetching, or any stimulus that halts retirement
# with the clock and the cache still running, plus the tag-RAM injection rate left on and the alert suppressed so
# the miss is genuine. Under landing 37's predicate that injection is excused, because no record retires at or after
# it; under landing 39's it is judged and fails, because its window closed inside the observed region. That is the
# discriminating pair, and it is the only shape that separates the two rules.
